      "url": "https://extension.umn.edu/vegetable-farming-minnesota/cover-crop-selection-vegetable-growers",
      "context": "Cover crops suppress weeds and erosion; grasses add biomass, legumes add nitrogen, some mixes combine both."
    },
    "intercrop": {
